good to merge as-is. ~~Except for the fact that it doesn't yet have documentation or unit tests.~~\r\n\r\nThis adds a simple `@export_suffix` annotation that takes a string argument as a suffix (similar to the `suffix:` hint). It's implemented mostly the same as `@export_range`, but without the whole range part. It can be applied to ints, floats and vectors. It also accepts additional arguments as extra hints.\r\n\r\nI also noticed that `_parse_range_hint` gets called for some other variant types, such as quaternions and transforms, but I don't think changing the suffix/unit in those cases would make sense, so I left those out.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nExample from one of my projects:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1529\" height=\"645\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/96a2dd5e-0b2a-4cca-9b5a-33445a0c579c\" />\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https: